<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-017" chapter-id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen" source-id="s-chenshu-017-wangfen-ws1544244">
  <p id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">王通</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen:p001:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">公達</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen:p001:m0014" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AB">份</persName>，梁左光祿大夫。父<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen:p001:m0024" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>，司徒左長史。<persName id="c-chenshu-017-wangfen:p001:m0032" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA">琳</persName>，齊代娶梁武帝妹義興長公主，有子九人，嵭知名。</p>
</text>
